 change wakes the loop]" style="fillColor=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontStyle=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="1142" width="790" height="144" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4-40" value="26. finalize: terminatedContainer · readLogs (redacted) · buildStatus (domain.ParseTaskResult)" style="verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1515" y="1312" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1715" y="1312" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4-41" value="27. Status Succeeded + outputs   (or Failed + StructuredError)" style="verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;dashed=1;endSize=8;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1515" y="1348" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1315" y="1348" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4-42" value="28. task_outputs · captureLogs → task_logs · TASK_SUCCEEDED&#10;releaseReadyDependents (BLOCKED → READY, or AWAITING_APPROVAL, once every dependency SUCCEEDED) · settleExecution" style="verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1315" y="1398" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1115" y="1398" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4-43" value="29. once the pass has committed: ReleaseFinished → Release(handle)" style="verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="